# Canonical URL enforcement — permanently redirect .html versions to the
# extensionless canonical URL declared in each page's <link rel="canonical">.
# These are explicit (rather than relying on a dashboard "Pretty URLs"
# toggle) so the 301 is guaranteed regardless of Netlify site settings.
